        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/60b92dc1691c/events/1/3",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "native_source": "0x34989",
              "native_text_index": 2,
              "speaker": 12,
              "text": "哎呀!一大群男人追殺一個小姑娘,不覺得丟臉嗎?"
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/60b92dc1691c/events/1/4",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "native_source": "0x34989",
              "native_text_index": 2,
              "speaker": -1,
              "text": "妳的一拳讓我的部下得療養三個月,無故毆打王國駐軍可是重罪,乖乖的跟我回去說個明白吧!"
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/60b92dc1691c/events/1/5",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "native_source": "0x34989",
              "native_text_index": 2,
              "speaker": 12,
              "text": "誰教他對我亂瞄!你們王國軍都是這個樣子的嗎?"
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/60b92dc1691c/events/1/6",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "native_source": "0x34989",
              "native_text_index": 2,
              "speaker": -1,
              "text": "哼....不和妳吵了,給我抓起來!"
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/60b92dc1691c/events/1/7",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "native_source": "0x34989",
              "native_text_index": 2,
              "speaker": 1,
              "text": "咦!那邊有王國軍在圍攻一個小女孩,這是怎麼一回事?"
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/60b92dc1691c/events/1/8",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "native_source": "0x34989",
              "native_text_index": 2,
              "speaker": 13,
              "text": "喂,我們自己都顧不了了,不要再去湊熱鬧..."
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/60b92dc1691c/events/1/9",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "native_source": "0x34989",
              "native_text_index": 2,
              "speaker": 0,
              "text": "什麼!你能眼睜睜的看著一群王國軍欺負一個小女孩?我自己去收拾他們好了。"
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/60b92dc1691c/events/1/10",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "native_source": "0x34989",
              "native_text_index": 2,
              "speaker": 4,
              "text": "好啦好啦,我陪你去就是了,反正不差這幾個..."
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/60b92dc1691c/events/1/11",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "native_source": "0x34989",
              "native_text_index": 2,
              "speaker": 13,
              "text": "好吧,那就上吧!"
            }
          },
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "action_id": "legacy/action/60b92dc1691c/events/1/12",
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "event_state_index": 17,
              "event_state_value": 1,
              "native_event_id": 25,
